description:
&quot;Lancashire County Council is seeking tenders for the provision of Hard Plastic acceptance and recycling services. The services will comprise the acceptance, weighing and recycling of Hard Plastic waste arising from Authority Waste Facilities, and delivered to a Provider&#039;s Facility by the Authority and/or its transport contractor. The Services are being procured on the basis of two (2) Lots: Lot 1 - South/East Lancashire and Lot 2 - North/West Lancashire. 

The initial term from the Service Commencement Date will be two (2) years with the option to extend by any number of defined periods up to a maximum of twenty-four (24) months. The total maximum Framework Agreement duration from the Service Commencement Date being four (4) years. The anticipated Services Commencement Date is 01 February 2025.

Please see the invitation to tender documents for more information.&quot;
